# =============================================================================
# .gitignore
#
# IMPORTANT - WHY THE RAW DATA IS NOT COMMITTED
#
# The ECO6067 course materials grant use of public.csv for teaching and
# coursework only, and state explicitly:
#
#   "Please do not redistribute the data or download links, upload the data to
#    public repositories, or use the files commercially."
#
#   "Do not upload licensed, confidential, or otherwise restricted data to
#    GitHub. For restricted data, provide access instructions and document the
#    required input-folder structure."
#
# The repository is public, so data/public.csv is deliberately excluded and
# data/README.md documents how to obtain it. Everything else in the repository
# is either our own code and writing, or output generated by that code.
# =============================================================================

# ---- restricted raw data ----------------------------------------------------
# public.csv must NOT be published. See data/README.md for access instructions.
data/*.csv
data/*.dta
!data/README.md

# ---- logs -------------------------------------------------------------------
# Run artefacts that change on every execution.
logs/*.log

# ---- Stata transient files --------------------------------------------------
*.smcl
*.stpr
*.stso

# ---- OS / editor ------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
